  Caller path: internal/api/devtools_handler.go:40,85,810
    devtools_handler instantiates database.NewFleetSubscriptionRepo
    and persists tesla.FleetTelemetrySubscription rows. After 000161
    drops the table, every Create / GetLatestByVIN / List call from
