The gate as written cannot pass even on a fully consistent code base
where the only surviving references are to recreated tables. To pass
honestly the gate would have to be amended to either (a) restrict the
grep to the tables in the drop list that are NOT subsequently
recreated by 000169-000175, or (b) accept that direct SQL references
to common-named recreated tables are valid and verify them against
the post-0175 column set instead. Per covenant #2 ("No scope
narrowing -- run the exact gate command, no subsets"), this prompt
cannot make either change unilaterally.

